{"hw":"ἴτον","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἴτον</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἴτον</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τό</span>, Thracian name for a kind of <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">mushroom</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Thphr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">167</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plin.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HN</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.36</span> </span>; prob. fr. <span class=\"gk\">ϝίτον</span>, cf. <span class=\"gk\">οἰτόν, οὐιτόν</span>.</div></div>"}